5xl lg:text-6xl">How it works</h2><p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg text-white/70">Three steps. One chat. Zero friction.</p></div><div class="space-y-24 md:space-y-32"><div class="group relative" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 items-center "><div class="space-y-6 "><div class="relative inline-block"><div class="text-7xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-transparent md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl"><span class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-white/90 to-white/50 bg-clip-text" style="-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)">01</span></div><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 blur-3xl opacity-30 hidden md:block"><div class="h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2e5dff] to-[#6a8bff]"></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#2e5dff] hidden md:block"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -left-2 top-1/2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6a8bff]"></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Fund your wallet</h3><p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70 md:text-xl">Deposit from Polygon, Solana, Base, Ethereum, Bitcoin, or BNB. Scan the QR, send funds, and you&#x27;re live in minutes.</p><p class="text-sm text-white/60">Cross-chain deposits • Min $1 • No gas needed to trade</p></div></div><div class="flex justify-center " style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px) scale(0.9)"><div class="w-full max-w-[320px] md:max-w-[360px]"><img src="/images/deposit-funds.webp" srcSet="/images/responsive/deposit-funds-384.webp 384w, /images/responsive/deposit-funds-576.webp 576w, /images/responsive/deposit-funds-720.webp 720w, /images/deposit-funds.webp 1080w" sizes="(max-width: 375px) 288px, (max-width: 767px) 320px, 360px" alt="Fund your wallet - PolyBot interface" width="375" height="812" class="w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div><div class="absolute left-[60px] top-full hidden h-24 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 via-white/10 to-transparent lg:block"></div></div><div class="group relative" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 items-center lg:grid-flow-dense"><div class="space-y-6 lg:col-start-2"><div class="relative inline-block"><div class="text-7xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-transparent md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl"><span class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-white/90 to-white/50 bg-clip-text" style="-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)">02</span></div><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 blur-3xl opacity-30 hidden md:block"><div class="h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2e5dff] to-[#6a8bff]"></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#2e5dff] hidden md:block"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -left-2 top-1/2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6a8bff]"></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Copy the top traders</h3><p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70 md:text-xl">Browse the leaderboard, pick a proven winner, and mirror their trades automatically. Every position they open, you open.</p><p class="text-sm text-white/60">Ranked by P&amp;L • One-tap copy • Auto-mirrored in real time</p></div></div><div class="flex justify-center lg:col-start-1" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px) scale(0.9)"><div class="w-full max-w-[320px] md:max-w-[360px]"><img src="/images/copy-trading.webp" srcSet="/images/responsive/copy-trading-384.webp 384w, /images/responsive/copy-trading-576.webp 576w, /images/responsive/copy-trading-720.webp 720w, /images/copy-trading.webp 1080w" sizes="(max-width: 375px) 288px, (max-width: 767px) 320px, 360px" alt="Copy the top traders - PolyBot interface" width="375" height="812" class="w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div><div class="absolute left-[60px] top-full hidden h-24 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 via-white/10 to-transparent lg:block"></div></div><div class="group relative" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(60px)"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 items-center "><div class="space-y-6 "><div class="relative inline-block"><div class="text-7xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-transparent md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl"><span class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-white/90 to-white/50 bg-clip-text" style="-webkit-text-stroke:1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)">03</span></div><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 blur-3xl opacity-30 hidden md:block"><div class="h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2e5dff] to-[#6a8bff]"></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#2e5dff] hidden md:block"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -left-2 top-1/2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#6a8bff]"></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Set it on Auto-Pilot</h3><p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70 md:text-xl">Define your own rules and let PolyBot trade for you 24/7. Your personal bot, your strategy, fully on-chain.</p><p class="text-sm text-white/60">Custom rules • Runs 24/7 • You stay in control</p></div></div><div class="flex justify-center " style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px) scale(0.9)"><div class="w-full max-w-[320px] md:max-w-[360px]"><img src="/images/auto-pilot.webp" srcSet="/images/responsive/auto-pilot-384.webp 384w, /images/responsive/auto-pilot-576.webp 576w, /images/responsive/auto-pilot-720.webp 720w, /images/auto-pilot.webp 1080w" sizes="(max-width: 375px) 288px, (max-width: 767px) 320px, 360px" alt="Set it on Auto-Pilot - PolyBot interface" width="375" height="812" class="w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div></div></div><p class="mt-16 text-center text-sm text-white/60" style="opacity:0">Every trade still routes through your Safe. View fills on Polymarket or Polygonscan.</p></div></section><!--/$--><!--$--><section id="feature-deck" aria-labelledby="feature-deck-heading" class="content-visibility-auto relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/8 bg-[#030407] py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute left-[8%] top-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-[#2e5dff]/10 blur-[140px]"></div><div class="absolute bottom-20 right-[7%] h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-violet-500/8 blur-[160px]"></div></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="mb-9 grid gap-6 lg:mb-11 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_390px] lg:items-end"><div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]"><span class="rounded-full border border-[#7895ff]/22 bg-[#2e5dff]/8 px-3 py-1.5 text-[#aebcff]">What PolyBot does</span><span class="text-white/30">5 tools live · 1 coming soon</span></div><h2 id="feature-deck-heading" class="mt-5 max-w-4xl text-balance font-display text-[40px] font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.045em] text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-[64px]">Copy traders. Automate strategies. Protect every position.</h2></div><div class="border-l border-white/10 pl-5 lg:pb-1"><p class="text-[14px] leading-7 text-white/52 sm:text-[15px]">PolyBot brings copy trading, automated execution, risk controls, alerts, and referral rewards into one Telegram-native trading system.</p><p class="mt-4 font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/28">Explore each feature</p></div></div><div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[330px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-5"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-1 lg:gap-2.5" aria-label="PolyBot feature modes"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-controls="feature-deck-stage" class="group relative min-h-[82px] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border px-3 py-3 text-