ld uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#89a3ff]">Order execution</span><h3 class="font-display mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white">Choose and troubleshoot order types</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/58">Understand FOK, FAK, GTC, GTD, partial fills, tick size, and failed orders.</p><span class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-8 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Read guide<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a class="group flex min-h-64 flex-col rounded-[24px] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-6 transition-[border-color,background-color,transform] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[#89a3ff]/45 hover:bg-white/[0.055] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#89a3ff]" href="/blog/polymarket-cash-out-sell-redeem-withdraw-guide"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#89a3ff]">Cash out</span><h3 class="font-display mt-5 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-white">Sell, redeem, and withdraw</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/58">Follow the right path for active positions, resolved winnings, and wallet balance.</p><span class="mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-2 pt-8 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Read guide<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><!--$--><section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading" class="content-visibility-auto relative border-t border-white/8 bg-black py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-24"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[280px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-16"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.34em] text-white/36">§ Support · Manual</p><h2 id="faq-heading" class="mt-5 font-display text-[40px] font-semibold leading-[0.98] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-[54px]">Frequently asked.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/46">The essentials, kept close to the final decision.</p><div class="mt-7 hidden items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/28 lg:flex"><span class="h-px w-9 bg-white/14"></span>11<!-- --> entries</div></div><div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div><article id="what-is-polybot"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="what-is-polybot-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">01</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">What is PolyBot?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-[#6a8bff]/45 bg-[#2e5dff]/10 text-[#a9b9ff]" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="what-is-polybot-panel" aria-hidden="false" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>PolyBot is a Telegram trading bot for Polymarket. It lets you trade prediction markets from Telegram with fast execution, copy trading, automated strategies, and risk controls.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="trade-polymarket-from-telegram"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="trade-polymarket-from-telegram-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">02</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">How do I trade Polymarket from Telegram?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="trade-polymarket-from-telegram-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>Open PolyBot in Telegram, connect your Safe wallet, fund it with USDC, and place market or limit orders directly from chat. PolyBot keeps the trading workflow inside Telegram so you can react quickly without switching apps.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="safe-access"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="safe-access-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">03</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">Is PolyBot non-custodial?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="safe-access-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>PolyBot is built around a Safe wallet setup you control. You keep access to your wallet, can export the owner key, and can withdraw funds whenever you choose.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="fees"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fees-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">04</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">What are the fees?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="fees-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>PolyBot charges a transparent 1% flat fee on successful trades.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="markets"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="markets-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">05</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">Which markets can I trade?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="markets-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>You can use PolyBot to trade Polymarket markets of any type.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="speed"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="speed-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">06</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">How fast are PolyBot trades?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="speed-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>PolyBot is built for fast execution. Market orders route immediately at the best available price, and limit orders trigger automatically once the market reaches your target. Funds settle after the on-chain confirmation.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="copy-trading"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="copy-trading-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">07</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">Does PolyBot support copy trading on Polymarket?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="copy-trading-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>Yes. PolyBot supports copy trading so you can follow selected wallets, set risk parameters, control sizing, and automate how trades are mirrored into your own portfolio.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="automated-strategies"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="automated-strategies-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">08</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">Can PolyBot automate trading strategies?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="automated-strategies-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>Yes. You can build automated strategies for crypto up/down markets with trigger prices, take-profit rules, stop-loss protection, trailing stops, and entry windows that execute from Telegram.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="polymarket-allows-bots"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="polymarket-allows-bots-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">09</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">Does Polymarket allow trading bots?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="polymarket-allows-bots-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>Polymarket publishes CLOB APIs and client libraries for programmatic market data, orders, and trading workflows. Automation still has to follow the current platform terms, market rules, and geographic restrictions, and a bot does not remove the user’s responsibility for the orders it places.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="bot-profitability"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="bot-profitability-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">10</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">Are Polymarket trading bots profitable?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="bot-profitability-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>No trading bot can guarantee profit. A bot executes a strategy faster and more consistently, but results still depend on the strategy, probability estimates, liquidity, spread, slippage, fees, position sizing, and risk management. Bad rules can automate losses just as efficiently as good rules automate execution.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><article id="market-vs-limit"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-start gap-4 py-5 text-left focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-black sm:gap-6 sm:py-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="market-vs-limit-panel"><span class="pt-1 font-mono text-[10px] tabular-nums text-white/28 sm:text-xs">11</span><span class="flex-1 font-display text-[19px] font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white/88 sm:text-[23px]">What’s the difference between market and limit orders?</span><span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-white/64 transition-colors motion-reduce:transition-none border-white/12 group-hover:border-white/28 group-hover:text-white" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button><div id="market-vs-limit-panel" aria-hidden="true" class="grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-300 ease-out motion-reduce:transition-none grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="min-h-0"><div class="max-w-3xl pb-6 pl-8 pr-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.72] text-white/58 sm:pb-7 sm:pl-12 sm:pr-12 sm:text-[15px]"><p>Market orders execute instantly at the best available price - perfect when speed matters more than the exact price.</p><p class="mt-4">Limit orders let you choose your exact price - your order only fills when the market reaches it, giving you full control over your entry or exit price.</p></div></div></div><div class="h-px w-full bg-white/10"></div></article><div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-white/28"><span>— End of manual</span><span>11<!-- --> entries</span></div></div></div></section><!--/$--></main><footer class="border-t border-white/8 bg-black py-9 sm:py-11"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(260px,.72fr)_minmax(0,1.28fr)] lg:gap-16"><div><div class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-white">PolyBot</div><p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/45">PolyBot is a Telegram trading bot for Polymarket. Copy top wallets, automate strategies with triggers and trailing stops, and manage risk — all from inside Telegram with a Safe wallet you own.</p></div><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:items-start"><nav aria-label="Product links"><p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-white/30">Product</p><ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-[13px] text-white/48 transition-colors hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black" href="/#how-it-works">How it works</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-[13px] text-white/48 transition-colors hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black" href="/#feature-deck">Feature deck</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-[13px] text-white/48 transition-colors hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#6a8bff] focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black" href="/wallet-analyzer">Wallet Analyzer</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-[13px] text-white/48 transition-colors hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible