1,\"name\":\"Polymarket Wallet Analyzer\",\"description\":\"Analyze Polymarket wallets, profile URLs, and usernames before turning a trader into a copy-trading setup.\",\"url\":\"https://polybot.trading/wallet-analyzer\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Polymarket Smart Wallets\",\"description\":\"Discover smart Polymarket wallets and top traders ranked by copy evidence, copyability, copy margin, and sample size.\",\"url\":\"https://polybot.trading/smart-wallets\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Polymarket Trading Competition Leaderboard\",\"description\":\"Track the PolyBot World Cup trading competition leaderboard, prize pool progress, qualification status, and top-50 volume rankings.\",\"url\":\"https://polybot.trading/competition\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Telegram Trading Bot for Polymarket\",\"description\":\"Trade Polymarket from Telegram with fast execution, copy trading, automated strategies, and Safe wallet control.\",\"url\":\"https://polybot.trading/telegram-trading-bot\"}]}8:Td59,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is PolyBot?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"PolyBot is a Telegram trading bot for Polymarket. It lets you trade prediction markets from Telegram with fast execution, copy trading, automated strategies, and risk controls.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I trade Polymarket from Telegram?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Open PolyBot in Telegram, connect your Safe wallet, fund it with USDC, and place market or limit orders directly from chat. PolyBot keeps the trading workflow inside Telegram so you can react quickly without switching apps.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is PolyBot non-custodial?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"PolyBot is built around a Safe wallet setup you control. You keep access to your wallet, can export the owner key, and can withdraw funds whenever you choose.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What are the fees?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"PolyBot charges a transparent 1% flat fee on successful trades.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which markets can I trade?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can use PolyBot to trade Polymarket markets of any type.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How fast are PolyBot trades?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"PolyBot is built for fast execution. Market orders route immediately at the best available price, and limit orders trigger automatically once the market reaches your target. Funds settle after the on-chain confirmation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does PolyBot support copy trading on Polymarket?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. PolyBot supports copy trading so you can follow selected wallets, set risk parameters, control sizing, and automate how trades are mirrored into your own portfolio.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can PolyBot automate trading strategies?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can build automated strategies for crypto up/down markets with trigger prices, take-profit rules, stop-loss protection, trailing stops, and entry windows that execute from Telegram.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Polymarket allow trading bots?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Polymarket publishes CLOB APIs and client libraries for programmatic market data, orders, and trading workflows. Automation still has to follow the current platform terms, market rules, and geographic restrictions, and a bot does not remove the user’s responsibility for the orders it places.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are Polymarket trading bots profitable?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No trading bot can guarantee profit. A bot executes a strategy faster and more consistently, but results still depend on the strategy, probability estimates, liquidity, spread, slippage, fees, position sizing, and risk management. Bad rules can automate losses just as efficiently as good rules automate execution.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What’s the difference between market and limit orders?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Market orders execute instantly at the best available price - perfect when speed matters more than the exact price. Limit orders let you choose your exact price - your order only fills when the market reaches it, giving you full control over your entry or exit price.\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a:T1430,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://polybot.trading/#organization\",\"name\":\"PolyBot\",\"alternateName\":[\"Trade PolyBot\",\"PolyBot Trading\"],\"url\":\"https://polybot.trading\",\"description\":\"PolyBot is a Polymarket trading bot for Telegram. Analyze smart wallets, copy top traders, automate orders, set risk controls, and trade from a Safe wallet.\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://polybot.trading/polybot-icon-512.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/TradePolyBot\",\"https://t.me/polybothub\",\"https://docs.polybot.trading/\"],\"knowsAbout\":[\"Polymarket\",\"Polymarket trading tools\",\"Telegram trading bots\",\"Prediction market copy trading\",\"Polymarket wallet analysis\",\"Polymarket wallet analyzer\",\"Polymarket smart wallet discovery\",\"Polymarket top traders\",\"Wallet discovery\",\"Automated trading strategies\",\"Stop-loss and take-profit automation\",\"Polymarket alerts and watchlists\",\"Polymarket bot safety\",\"Polymarket Telegram group trading\",\"Polymarket auto-claim and redemption\",\"Polymarket trading competitions\"]},